{"title": "Consume Life Essence", "pageid": 46319, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Consume_Life_Essence", "categories": ["Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp, /w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Consume Life Essence</b> is a passive feature granted by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Life Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\">Life Essence</a> condition.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Consume the life essence that you have collected to cast any Necromancy spell without consuming a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Life_Essence_Active\"> Condition: Life Essence Active </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_Active_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence Active (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Life Essence Active\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_Active_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence Active (Condition)\">Life Essence Active</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity next Necromancy spell can be cast without consuming a <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Previously, using <b>Consume Life Essence</b> did not actually remove the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Life Essence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Generic_Death_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Essence_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Essence (Condition)\">Life Essence</a> condition. This meant you could cast an unlimited number of Necromancy spells without consuming any spell slots. This behaviour has been fixed as of Patch 6.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203238\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.0